id: AUTHOR1-5
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: cli
target: crates/pack/src/cli.rs
find: Invocation::Vocab { pack_dir } => run_vocab(&pack_dir, out),
replace: Invocation::Vocab { pack_dir } => run_metrics(&pack_dir, out, err),
expect-fail: i11_vocab_is_dispatched_to_vocab
note: vocab の振り分けが metrics の handler になる
